<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 74.4000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 74.4000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 74.4000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Sunday from 73.8049 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Jan 5		   Dec 30</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  74.4000		 73.8049</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	     4.190		  11.215</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
